.................................","..............................====..........","........=====.........=====.................","............................................","..S..........................^........B.....","############################################","############################################"],"isBossRoom":true,"exit":{"toRoom":"END"}}],"dialogue":{"roomIntro":[[{"speaker":"Peppa","text":"It stopped raining! Can I go out and play, please?"},{"speaker":"Peppa","text":"George, stop following me! ...Okay, you can come."}],[{"speaker":"Peppa","text":"Muddy puddles everywhere! I love jumping in muddy puddles!"},{"speaker":"Suzy Sheep","text":"Peppa! Wait for me! Sheep can jump too!"}],[{"speaker":"Peppa","text":"That's the biggest muddy puddle in the whole world!"}]],"bossIntro":[{"speaker":"Daddy Pig","text":"Ho ho! I happen to be an expert at jumping in muddy puddles."},{"speaker":"Peppa","text":"Daddy! Let's see who makes the biggest splash!"}],"bossDefeated":[{"speaker":"Daddy Pig","text":"Oh dear. I'm covered in mud! Ho ho ho!"},{"speaker":"Peppa","text":"Everyone loves jumping in muddy puddles! *snort*"}],"playerDefeated":[{"speaker":"Peppa","text":"Waaah! I'm all muddy and it's not fun anymore!"},{"speaker":"Daddy Pig","text":"Never mind, Peppa. Let's have a bath and try again."}]}},"notes":{"sourceFacts":["'Muddy Puddles' is the first episode of Peppa Pig series 1.","Peppa and her little brother George love jumping up and down in muddy puddles.","Peppa wears a red dress; George carries his toy, Mr. Dinosaur.","In the episode Daddy Pig joins in jumping in the puddles and everyone ends up muddy.","Suzy Sheep and Danny Dog are Peppa's friends from the series."],"designChoices":["Daddy Pig is the boss: his big puddle jump in the episode became a jump-and-charge boss fight.","George, Suzy Sheep and Danny Dog are playful 'enemies'; Suzy and Danny are not in this episode.","Spikes stand in for prickly thistles in the grass (the engine has only spikes as a hazard).","Room order Peppa's Hill -> The Muddy Fields -> The Biggest Muddy Puddle is invented for the game.","Push, Muddy Splash and Giggle Fit are invented abilities based on Peppa's playground behaviour.","Danny Dog's yellow top and Suzy's pink dress are simplified colour choices for tiny sprites."]},"createdAt":"2026-11-21T12:00:00.000Z"}$$), '2026-11-21T12:00:00.000Z'::TIMESTAMP_TZ;

